WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.113 --> 00:00:02.696
(dreamy music)

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:06.499
- There are articles all around the world

00:00:06.499 --> 00:00:09.518
with pronouns like he, she, it, they.

00:00:09.518 --> 00:00:12.118
A lot of people just are
not quite sure what I am.

00:00:12.118 --> 00:00:15.951
And honestly, a little
mystery is kind of fun.

00:00:21.339 --> 00:00:24.593
I'm Rain Dove, and I am a model, activist,

00:00:24.593 --> 00:00:26.337
and general enjoyer of life.

00:00:26.337 --> 00:00:27.248
(magical chiming)

00:00:27.248 --> 00:00:30.221
(energetic funky dance music)

00:00:30.221 --> 00:00:34.156
So, I model as both a male and a female,

00:00:34.156 --> 00:00:37.073
or in both menswear and womenswear.

00:00:38.321 --> 00:00:39.912
I worked as a male bartender.

00:00:39.912 --> 00:00:41.781
I've worked as a fire fighter

00:00:41.781 --> 00:00:44.103
for a while under a male persona.

00:00:44.103 --> 00:00:45.845
I've done landscaping as male.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:48.724
Oh, I did power-washing
for a while in Long Island!

00:00:48.724 --> 00:00:50.361
(moves into mellow alternative music)

00:00:50.361 --> 00:00:53.484
I feel like every day
that I do more modeling,

00:00:53.484 --> 00:00:55.551
every day that I say
I'm not gonna stop doing

00:00:55.551 --> 00:00:57.466
what I'm doing, it's another day

00:00:57.466 --> 00:01:00.264
in which I'm representing a community

00:01:00.264 --> 00:01:04.868
that isn't stopping what
they're doing either.

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:08.106
My mission is not to look fancy.

00:01:08.106 --> 00:01:09.929
My mission is to show people

00:01:09.929 --> 00:01:13.879
that they belong, that they are beautiful,

00:01:13.879 --> 00:01:16.056
that they are handsome,
that they are attractive,

00:01:16.056 --> 00:01:17.925
and that they deserve to be elevated.

00:01:17.925 --> 00:01:21.925
(moves into spacey dance music)

00:01:23.518 --> 00:01:24.807
It is hard to protect yourself

00:01:24.807 --> 00:01:28.441
from being exploited and
turned into a gimmick

00:01:28.441 --> 00:01:31.599
by designers who are trying something new

00:01:31.599 --> 00:01:33.596
or trying to get a bang for their buck.

00:01:33.596 --> 00:01:35.059
But at the same time, in a weird way,

00:01:35.059 --> 00:01:36.684
I really want to be exploited.

00:01:36.684 --> 00:01:39.737
I want somebody to say,
yeah, let's try a gimmick.

00:01:39.737 --> 00:01:40.713
Because I want them to see

00:01:40.713 --> 00:01:43.043
how wildly successful that gimmick is.

00:01:43.043 --> 00:01:45.772
I want them to start putting
people that look like me

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:49.945
or people that are different
on the runway regularly.

00:01:49.945 --> 00:01:51.332
I'm really hoping that people see

00:01:51.332 --> 00:01:53.689
that I'm not a model, I'm a movement.

00:01:53.689 --> 00:01:56.439
I'm a human and, like, that's it.

